  "answer": "This feature has been requested before. PowerToys#46232 is the tracking thread for showing system tray icons on the Dock. A PowerToys maintainer said the team probably can't ship tray icon support in the Dock itself. They said a third-party Command Palette extension that shows tray icons as a Dock band would be welcome, and nobody has built one yet. The thread is still open as a tracker. You can add a 👍 to #46232 to show demand. You could also build or install a community extension. PowerToys#48211 also asks for tray support and points back to #46232."
 },
